From: RelayLM cache diagnostic
Subject: [DIAGNOSTIC ONLY] dump Gemma4 KV prefix at logical boundary, independent of physical batch size

Target: ggml-org/llama.cpp @ e2d2c0d6aa9b996d5d3a3c1d5e24c8c19728bb3d

This patch is diagnostic instrumentation only. It keeps Flash Attention enabled,
does not add graph nodes, and dumps already-computed KV payload after context
synchronization. Rows are ordered by logical sequence position so physical cell
layout differences do not contaminate KV-value comparison.

